     '{"purpose": "repaired-reference-difference", "method": "direct-render-review + measured difference", "reference": "poppler-pdftotext of a MuPDF xref-rebuilt copy (verify_extraction.rebuilt_reference)", "reference_page_sha256": "e49503c5a357adfc2af97a716855f96e8879864fdb837b1aa6c4501f7192a81d", "missing_strings": ["i", "p", "r", "v", "l", "l", "m", "t", "d", "́", "m", "s", "s", "t", "f", "l", "h", "·", "s", "l", "f", "f", "2"], "extra_strings": ["e", "“", "’", "–"], "render": "claude/renders/doc4608-p2.png", "render_sha256": "82975bcd7ccadf3b0267658e238d24fdcee0e63bcbff3b5c4cd5e149cc11186b", "owner_decision": [{"export": ".artifacts/decision-review/exports/decision-review-2026-10-14-l.json", "document_id": 4608, "question_id": "q1"}, {"export": ".artifacts/decision-review/exports/decision-review-2026-10-14-l.json", "document_id": 4608, "question_id": "q2"}]}'::jsonb),
    (3, 'Page 3 of this blob: Poppler cannot open the file (missing trailer/xref; decode_damage #3), so the independent check reads Poppler''s text of a MuPDF xref-rebuilt copy of the same bytes. The page differs from the stored layer only by: (a) 2 broken-glyph artefacts Poppler reads from the damaged font (e.g. ''mu'', a lone combining acute, a middle dot) -- no such characters are printed on the page; (b) 17 letters the stored layer drops where the damaged font sets a glyph twice (doubled letters such as ''ll'', ''ss'', ''tt'', ''mm'', and the repeated I of ''XVIII'' and ''XLII'') -- restored in the text by the reviewed readings of claude/agJE/patch-4608.json (owner export j q1 ''repair-from-image'', confirmed export l 14 Oct q1/q2); (c) 4 characters the stored layer has and the rebuilt reference loses: the curly quotation marks (and an en dash) printed around the inserted definitions on the render, and single letters of broken words. Render doc4608-p3.png sha256 79125cda0f407a7d422b8a63b77985616febedd73089b6b96e36dd62bb9edd5c.',
     '{"purpose": "repaired-reference-difference", "method": "direct-render-review + measured difference", "reference": "poppler-pdftotext of a MuPDF xref-rebuilt copy (verify_extraction.rebuilt_reference)", "reference_page_sha256": "1655aada93f3df374f7a774f22d36d56323cabb11d884da26caaf54671bb66c3", "missing_strings": ["a", "ii", "hv·", "p", "e", "l", "́", "m", "s", "n", "te", "t", "t", "l", "s", "m", "l"], "extra_strings": ["’", "“", "o", "o"], "render": "claude/renders/doc4608-p3.png", "render_sha256": "79125cda0f407a7d422b8a63b77985616febedd73089b6b96e36dd62bb9edd5c", "owner_decision": [{"export": ".artifacts/decision-review/exports/decision-review-2026-10-14-l.json", "document_id": 4608, "question_id": "q1"}, {"export": ".artifacts/decision-review/exports/decision-review-2026-10-14-l.json", "document_id": 4608, "question_id": "q2"}]}'::jsonb)
